{"id": "t040-008", "text": "chat w/ xavier after 5 a side. his partner noor got made redundant last wk and they're stressing about the mortgage. he's got an interview himself at a logistics firm on monday at 2 but says he's not holding his breath. noor's looking at retraining as a teacher. must check in w/ him monday evening afterwards and maybe drop round some food for them", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "xavier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after 5 a side"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "noor", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last wk", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing about the mortgage", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview himself at a logistics firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "monday at 2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "noor", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking at retraining as a teacher", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w/ him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "monday evening afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some food for them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t040-012", "text": "gintaras is into chess big time, plays online every night, rated like 1900. wants a proper wooden set one day", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "gintaras", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rated like 1900", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a proper wooden set", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "one day"}]}
{"id": "t040-016", "text": "moira's grandson alfie has his grade 3 piano exam on the 12th at half 9. she said he practises every morning b4 school and gets really worked up about it, cried after the last mock. his dad's taking him that morning and moira's doing pizza afterwards to celebrate whatever happens. ask her how it went a few days after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "grandson", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "alfie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 3 piano exam", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning b4 school"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worked up", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the last mock"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t040-017", "text": "lunch w/ jada. she's applying for a masters in illustration, portfolio due jan. her mum's not keen on her quitting work for it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "masters in illustration", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "jan", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not keen", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
