{"id": "t040-028", "text": "james okafor (jimmy) interview fri at 3pm for the senior analyst job. he's been prepping all wk and is properly nervous. text him the night b4 and then ring him afterwards", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "james okafor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "jimmy", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "fri at 3pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all wk"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night b4", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t040-029", "text": "bumped into noor and her husband obi at the market. they're moving to bristol in jan, obi got a transfer w/ his firm. their eldest starts uni there in sept anyway so it works out. noor's sad about leaving her book club, she's run it for 6 yrs. they're having a leaving do the sat before they go, need to put it in the calendar once they confirm", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "obi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in jan", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "obi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "transfer w/ his firm", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in sept", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "book club", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 yrs"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the sat before they go", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "put it in the calendar", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "once they confirm", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t040-037", "text": "talked to alana on the phone. her son isaac is struggling at his new school, keeps saying he has no friends. she's seeing his teacher thurs after pickup. check in w/ her friday. isaac's really into lego technic and minecraft so maybe something for the wknd w/ our two would help", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "isaac", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new school", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "seeing his teacher", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs after pickup", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w/ her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "isaac", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "lego technic", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "minecraft", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wknd"}]}
